# No Git LFS.
#
# Railway builds from a snapshot tarball (no .git), so it never resolves LFS
# objects — LFS-tracked files arrive as useless pointer stubs. Therefore:
#   - datos/*.pdf are committed as plain git blobs so they materialize in the
#     Railway build and the app can read/cite them.
#   - storage/ (the ~950 MB vector index) is NOT tracked at all; it's a build
#     artifact rebuilt from ./datos at runtime and kept on a Railway Volume.
